{# THE DEPARTMENT REGISTER + LENS ICONS, inline as SVG the way the module's own
   _bits macros are (positions/_bits, team/_bits). The canonical design draws
   these exact glyphs; they are copied verbatim so the register and the lens read
   as the design does. Sized on the macro, never on the page, per the
   InlineIconsAreSized rule the template suite enforces. #}

